    "focus": "ISSUE-530c5e079d4edfcd: (1) the planner refuses an empty template catalog with a typed error naming the target, before building the wire schema or calling a model (src/analyze/planner/wire-schema.ts, src/analyze/planner/driver.ts); (2) the CLI provider adds a summary of the schema keywords it sent to the error it raises when codex answers invalid_json_schema (src/agent/providers/cli-provider.ts); tests for both.",
    "producesLld": false,
    "commit": "7efbf01e6",
