        "id": "s1",
        "passed": true
      }
    ],
    "summary": "The planner throws EmptyPlanCatalogError (no templates for the target) before building its schema or calling a model; a codex invalid_json_schema rejection now appends a keyword summary (schema keywords sent, empty lists located; literal data under const/enum/default/examples is not read as keywords) to its error. Tests: driver-unit (empty catalog), cli-codex-strict-schema (refusal summary and the data boundary); scope-before-plan now registers the builtin templates.",
